{
  "title": "8th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَللّٰهُمَّ ارْزُقْنِىْ فِيْهِ رَحْمَةَ الْاَيْتَامِ، وَ اِطْعَامَ الطَّعَامِ، وَ اِفْشَاۤءَ السَّلَامِ، وَصُحْبَةَ الْكِرَامِ، بِطَوْلِكَ يَا مَلْجَاَ الْاٰمِلِيْنَ.\nALLAAHUMMAR ZUQNEE FEEHE RAHMATAL AYTAAME WA IT-A'AMAT TA-A'AME WA IFSHAA-AS SALAAME WA SOHBATAL KERAAME BE-TAWLEKA YAA MAL-JA-AL AAMELEENA.\nO Allah, on this day, (please) grant me having mercy upon the orphans, serving food, greeting the people, and accompanying the noble ones, in the name of Your favoring, O Shelter of the hopeful ones!"
}
